        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global TH1100-RP124D-2ZCP, 4-1/2 Inch Hinge Reinforcement Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n951 U model mounting plate for 4-1/2\" high hinge. For use with metal doors or metal door frame. Standard 4-1/2 inch hinge template screw pattern. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Other <a href=\"/collections/reinforcement-plates-and-shims\"><b>Hinge Mounting Plates</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omnia-19000-series-size.gif?v=1704442279\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Global TH1100-RP124D-2ZCP 4.5 Inch Hinge Reinforcement plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse when existing mounting is missing, damaged or new 4-1/2\" butt hinge installation. Plate is attached with (4) #12-24 screws to the inside of metal door or frame. Hinge mounting holes are tapped for <a href=\"/products/machine-screw-12-x-1-2-scms1205\">#12-24 hinge screws</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the TH1100-RP124D-2ZCP 4-1/2\" Hinge Mounting Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7.953\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1.189\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Offset: .030\" (for standard weight .134\" thick hinge)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .120\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel, Zinc plated</li>\r\n<li>Mounting: (4) holes tapped 12-24</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
